  displayName: Calcium Pulse
  description: "Inside the cell, a sudden rise in calcium works as a signal that
    triggers movement and phagocytosis. In the game it gives you an extra jump; in
    real life it gives the cell the \u201Cgo\u201D to reach out and grab its target."
  gameHint: Extra jump for a while.
